# In Bot2's turn the equipped Memnite has reach, so it can block Bot2's attacking Ornithopter (flying 0/2): Memnite deals 2 damage and
# kills it. Ornithopter has power 0, so Memnite survives and Bot1 takes no damage. The block is only legal because of the reach.

[Bot1 Deck]
Memnite
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Hunter's Blowgun
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hunter's Blowgun.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Hunter's Blowgun.Activate(Ability: Equip; Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Memnite > Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Damage = 0
